msgid "对象填充"
msgstr "Object fill"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:7
msgid "简介"
msgstr "Introduction"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:9
msgid "颜色显示节点用于在图像中检测到的对象上叠加矩形颜色块，创建彩色的可视化效果。"
msgstr ""
"The Color Display node is used to overlay rectangular blocks of color on "
"detected objects in the image, creating a colorful visualization."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:11
msgid "该节点支持多种颜色方案、透明度调节和灵活的配置选项，常用于语义分割、实例分割等任务的结果展示。"
msgstr ""
"This node supports multiple color schemes, transparency adjustment and "
"flexible configuration options, and is often used to display the results of "
"semantic segmentation, instance segmentation and other tasks."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:13
msgid "效果展示："
msgstr "Effect display:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:14
