msgstr "Parameter name"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:39
msgid "说明"
msgstr "illustrate"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:40
msgid "示例/默认值"
msgstr "Example/Default"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:41
msgid "**节点名称**"
msgstr "**Node name**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:42
msgid "步骤名称，用于标识该节点的唯一标识符"
msgstr "Step name, a unique identifier used to identify this node"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:43
msgid "``color_visualization_1``"
msgstr "``color_visualization_1``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:44
msgid "**备注**"
msgstr "**Remark**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:45
msgid "可选的备注信息，用于描述该步骤的用途"
msgstr "Optional remarks describing the purpose of this step"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:46
msgid "留空"
msgstr "Leave blank"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:47
msgid "**输入图像**"
msgstr "**Input image**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:48
msgid "指定输入图像的来源，可以是上游节点的输出或工作流的输入参数"
msgstr ""
"Specify the source of the input image, which can be the output of an "
"upstream node or an input parameter of a workflow"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:49
msgid "``input.image``"
msgstr "``input.image``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:50
#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:75
msgid "**复制图像**"
msgstr "**COPY IMAGE**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:51
msgid "是否创建输入图像的副本进行可视化，启用后不会修改原始图像"
msgstr ""
"Whether to create a copy of the input image for visualization. When enabled,"
" the original image will not be modified."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:52
msgid "``True(推荐)``"
msgstr "``True(recommended)``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:53
#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:80
msgid "**预测显示**"
msgstr "**Forecast Display**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:54
msgid "要可视化的模型预测结果，从下拉菜单选择"
msgstr "To visualize model prediction results, select from the drop-down menu"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:55
msgid "``<model>.predictions``"
msgstr "``<model>.predictions``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:56
#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:84
msgid "**调色板**"
msgstr "**Palette**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:57
msgid "颜色调色板方案，用于为不同类别分配颜色"
msgstr "Color palette scheme for assigning colors to different categories"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:58
msgid "``DEFAULT``"
msgstr "``DEFAULT``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:59
#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:92
msgid "**调色板大小**"
msgstr "**Palette size**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:60
msgid "调色板中的颜色数量，适用于使用自定义或Matplotlib调色板时"
msgstr ""
"Number of colors in the palette, applicable when using a custom or "
"Matplotlib palette"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:61
msgid "``10``"
msgstr "``10``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:62
#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:96
msgid "**自定义颜色**"
msgstr "**Custom Color**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:63
msgid "自定义颜色列表，使用HEX格式定义颜色"
msgstr "Custom color list, define colors using HEX format"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:64
msgid "``[\"#FF0000\", \"#00FF00\", \"#0000FF\"]``"
msgstr "``[\"#FF0000\", \"#00FF00\", \"#0000FF\"]``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:65
#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:106
msgid "**颜色坐标轴**"
msgstr "**Color Axis**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:66
msgid "颜色分配的依据，通常基于类别（CLASS）来着色"
msgstr ""
"The basis for color assignment, usually coloring based on category (CLASS)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:67
msgid "``CLASS``"
msgstr "``CLASS``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:68
#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:114
msgid "**透明度**"
msgstr "**transparency**"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:69
msgid "叠加覆盖层的透明度，范围0-1，值越小越透明"
msgstr ""
"The transparency of the overlay, ranging from 0 to 1. The smaller the value,"
" the more transparent it is."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:70
msgid "``0.5``"
msgstr "``0.5``"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:73
msgid "参数详细说明"
msgstr "Detailed description of parameters"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:77
msgid "**True**：创建图像副本，原始图像保持不变，可用于后续其他可视化操作"
msgstr ""
"**True**: Create a copy of the image, the original image remains unchanged "
"and can be used for other subsequent visualization operations"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:78
msgid "**False**：直接在原图上绘制，节省内存但会修改原图"
msgstr ""
"**False**: Draw directly on the original image, saving memory but modifying "
"the original image."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:82
msgid "选择要可视化的模型预测输出。从下拉菜单中选择上游模型节点的输出结果，支持语义分割、实例分割等模型类型。"
msgstr ""
"Select the model prediction output to visualize.Select the output result of "
"the upstream model node from the drop-down menu, supporting model types such"
" as semantic segmentation and instance segmentation."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:86
msgid "支持多种颜色调色板方案："
msgstr "Supports multiple color palette schemes:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:88
msgid "``DEFAULT``：系统默认配色方案"
msgstr "``DEFAULT``: system default color scheme"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:89
msgid "``MATPLOTLIB``：使用Matplotlib的颜色方案"
msgstr "``MATPLOTLIB``: Use Matplotlib's color scheme"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:90
msgid "``CUSTOM``：使用自定义颜色列表（需配置自定义颜色参数）"
msgstr ""
"``CUSTOM``: Use a custom color list (custom color parameters need to be "
"configured)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:94
msgid "设置调色板中的颜色数量。当使用 ``MATPLOTLIB`` 调色板时，此参数决定从调色板中采样多少种颜色。默认值为 ``10``。"
msgstr ""
"Set the number of colors in the palette.When using the ``MATPLOTLIB`` "
"palette, this parameter determines how many colors are sampled from the "
"palette.The default value is ``10``."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:98
msgid "当调色板选择 ``CUSTOM`` 时，使用HEX格式定义颜色列表："
msgstr ""
"When ``CUSTOM`` is selected for the palette, use HEX format to define the "
"color list:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:104
msgid "分别对应红色、绿色、蓝色、黄色、紫色，颜色会按顺序分配给不同的类别。"
msgstr ""
"Corresponding to red, green, blue, yellow, and purple, the colors will be "
"assigned to different categories in order."

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:108
msgid "决定如何为检测结果分配颜色："
msgstr "Decide how to assign colors to detection results:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:110
msgid "``CLASS``：根据物体类别着色，同类物体使用相同颜色"
msgstr ""
"``CLASS``: Color according to object category, similar objects use the same "
"color"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:111
msgid "``INDEX``：为每个物体分配不同颜色"
msgstr "``INDEX``: assign a different color to each object"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:112
msgid "``TRACK``：根据Tracker ID着色，每个Tracker ID使用不同颜色"
msgstr ""
"``TRACK``: Colored according to Tracker ID, use different colors for each "
"Tracker ID"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:116
msgid "设置颜色覆盖层的透明度，取值范围为 ``0`` 到 ``1``："
msgstr ""
"Sets the transparency of the color overlay, ranging from ``0`` to ``1``:"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:118
msgid "``0``：完全透明（不可见）"
msgstr "``0``: completely transparent (invisible)"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:119
msgid "``1.0``：完全不透明，覆盖原图"
msgstr "``1.0``: completely opaque, covering the original image"

#: ../../source/block_gallery/visualization/color_display.rst:121
msgid "透明度越低，原始图像越清晰；透明度越高，颜色覆盖效果越明显。"
msgstr ""
"The lower the transparency, the clearer the original image; the higher the "
"transparency, the more obvious the color coverage effect."
